 "blurb": "Interactive poll collecting single or multi-vote feature requests with live…",
 "description": "Compound component system (Root, Header, Title, Description, Options, Option, Indicator, Label, Footer) supporting single or multiple-choice voting. Shows vote counts and percentages, tracks selection state, keyboard-accessible option…",
 "use_when": "Feature voting or priority surveys where users pick options and results update live.",
 "avoid_when": "Very large option counts (layout not designed for dense lists) or when results must be hidden until submission.",
 "a11y": "Options are buttons with full keyboard navigation (arrow keys, enter). Supports both controlled (value prop) and uncontrolled (defaultValue) selection. Focus management and ARIA attributes via…",
